BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-24850@shift2bikes.org
SUMMARY:Bike Social Hour
DESCRIPTION:* Build Community * Hatch Ideas * Ride Bikes *\n\nJoin other 
 bike-minded folks for drinks\, food and community every Wednesday from 4-7
  (or so). Bike Social Hour is a place where everyone is welcomed and 
 embraced by our community. Just show up and hang out. That's it! 
 \n\nFamily Night: all ages are welcome any night\, but first Wednesday of 
 the month is Family Night\, when kiddos can expect extra activities & more
  other kids to play with.\n\n5:30 pm - Open Mic. Special guest speeches 
 and announcements. Everyone is welcome to share\, no invitation 
 needed.\n\nFollow @bikeloudpdx on insta for updates and info about special
  themed nights or special guest appearances. Contact bikeloudpdx@gmail.com
  with questions/requests/theme suggestions.\n\nSummer location is Rainbow 
 Road Pub. We will shift to Migration Brewing at 3947 N Williams starting 
 in November.\n4-7pm\nhttps://shift2bikes.org/calendar/event-24850
LOCATION:Migration Brewing\n3947 N Williams Ave\, Portland\, OR 97227
STATUS:CONFIRMED
