BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-25072@shift2bikes.org
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Ride
DESCRIPTION:TNR #607: Mitch\nThursday Night Ride is Portland’s longest-
 running weekly social ride\, rolling out from Salmon Street Springs every 
 Thursday night since 2015!\n\nRoutes and ride leaders change weekly\, but 
 expect an energetic\, party-paced social ride with warmth and weirdness 
 from our welcoming “rolling dive bar” regulars. Most rides feature 
 regularly spaced park and store stops\, generally leading to a lively end 
 spot around 11 PM. Come prepared to have fun and celebrate cycling 
 together—other wheeled guests should respect the pace and space of 
 cyclists.\n\nStrong Thursday traditions\, stronger shared expectations. 
 While you might see some wheelies and other chaos\, riders are expected to
  follow Shift’s Code of Conduct. If you’ve been asked not to attend *any* 
 Shift rides\, you are not welcome at TNR—that’s not up for debate on our 
 ride. No complaints\, just accountability—if your behavior makes others 
 feel uncomfortable or unsafe\, please leave the ride before the ride 
 leaves you.\n\nTNR works best when everyone helps set the tone and shares 
 responsibility. Look out for each other\, welcome new riders and help them
  find the next stop\, leave it better than you found it\, give people 
 space when they need it\, and help keep the ride moving forward together 
 by practicing Consent\, Accountability\, Respect\, and De-escalation at 
 all times.\nStay behind the ride leader and don’t forget to thank a 
 corker!\n\n📍 Salmon Street Springs\, every Thursday\, rain or shine.\n🕖 
 Meet at 7:00\, announcements after 7:30\, leave after “Beer Minutes.”\n🕢 
 If you’re not at the fountain by 7:30\, you may want to meet us at the 
 next stop.\n🧭 Ride Tracker: 
 \nhttps://thursdaynightride.com/tracker\n\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/users/1
 303039/live_log\nMeet at 7:00\, announcements around 7:30. 🕢 After 7:30\,
  follow us to the next stop.\nEnds at Not a loop\, but usually with a 
 fire.\nhttps://shift2bikes.org/calendar/event-25072
LOCATION:Salmon Street Springs\n1000 SW Naito Pkwy\, Portland\, OR 97204
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART:20261120T030000Z
DTEND:20261120T040000Z
CREATED:20261001T093206Z
